Package: freemius
Version: 0.2.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libegl1, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, libc6
Maintainer: Sornodod <sornodod@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Sornodod/Freemius
Description: Freemius SSH/SFTP client
 GUI SSH client with terminal emulator, SFTP file transfer,
 and support for storing connections. Built with PyQt6 + paramiko.
